<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- Akzo Nobel H1 net 799 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Akzo Nobel H1 net 799 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     799  vs  699</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	     11.22  vs  9.83</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges			nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			12.03  vs 11.26</p>
<p>    Operating profit (billions)	     1.21  vs  1.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast a net profit before extraordinary items of 715-768 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
